summary: File manager: track the selected path (mf_watch = false)

The ''Add to DB'' of the [[file-manager panel]]: creates the metarecord of the entry under the cursor, and those of its parent directories, with `mf_watch = false` — recorded, not yet watched ([[Tracking a folder]]). On an entry already tracked it changes nothing; outside the repository root, or with no repository, it is refused in the status bar.
